{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"835782a79e00d13e274a9dd06d58be637e9e36dc8ee98ba09b1abeb8b0f76010","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"b3f1b4a2e25bc4b8b08669a947d62c897f39ebc99c40af36e87446c3a711cf7e","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b3f4d3c83cf6c026817bc32d3fa3d61698d6e7c6e6333f00dc59561ca2384b4f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b437b99574b4dd3894e7d8c6da1b66057e68e30c469b1908a1d0142e4ab5ba6a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b4679de67acbaa75761a363e8eaa145d6eed1827be25e348aec4d8d4f83a4f50","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b4989e1df22170f87b14a2fc0500bb37dd109311bdf48ab29a4b97d501047623","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"heavy-weapons.lua:152 首句原文为“You replace your steamgun and attack with an incendiary device that projects streams of liquid flame at your foes.”（改用向敌人喷射液态火焰流的燃烧装置进行攻击）。译文“替换成一把强大的蒸汽动力的喷火器，将你的敌人化为灰烬”是按另一版本的文案译的：“强大的蒸汽动力”“化为灰烬”是原文没有的内容，“attack with”和“projects streams of liquid flame at your foes”则被漏掉。第154行的“to enemies”（只作用于敌人）也没有译出。"},{"revision_key":"b4d7ff1a4001d0be91d23b12e86ebde6437657b8d2197034fcc6b45956772611","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"turrets.lua:732 原文是“project a vortex of superheated air that drags targets within range %d”（过热空气形成的漩涡，拉动范围内的目标）。译文写成“灼热蒸汽的漩涡”，把“空气”改成了“蒸汽”；又把“targets”扩大为“所有敌人”，而原文没有限定只作用于敌人。另外，第730行的“%d%% increased maximum life”译成“获得 %d%% 最大生命值”，丢了“增加”的意思，容易被理解为生命值变成最大生命值的 %d%%。"},{"revision_key":"b5c9934b1171e91a7919e1e65b3dc09abf3f0de927ce979935f7427ae2024eb1","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"to-mainland.lua:24 原文是“before we free them you must secure a way to the mainland”。句中执行者是“you”（玩家），译文改成了“我们必须”；“before”表示先后顺序，被改成了目的“为了解放他们”。“secure a way”意为夺取、打通一条通路，第27行完成文本“You have destroyed the sunwall outpost, and secured a way to the mainland”可以印证，指的是攻下前哨；译文“找到一条……安全的路”偏离了这层意思。"},{"revision_key":"b6ae150553ec66f89be082249cb66554630d1562d3e1177a9d91a43b5e30c16d","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"换行数量不一致：原文（psionic-fog.lua:184-185）只在“The damage will increase with your Mindpower.”之前有一处“\\n\\t\\t”，“lasts %d turns.”与“Any foes caught inside”在同一行。译文在“灵能之雾。”之后多加了一处“\\n\\t\\t”，共两处，破坏了换行不变量。"},{"revision_key":"b6e17ee9e443227481036ba60e930b8df7598b67835811049e766fb45a9b4f84","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b79ff5b10bff32d2cc8723309112c2095d344a1685a351e757183b79da8cab2b","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b7d5bb68d3a17c91f0cfcb3e67b552b04034d48686f5708f74e6d2d6739b5ae6","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"mechstar.lua:95-96 有内容漏译：第一句的“burns part of your victim's flesh”（灼烧受害者部分血肉）被删掉，只剩“同时造成火焰伤害”；第二句的“The intensity of the fire generates steam which you psionically absorb through gestalt”被压缩成“火焰同时产生蒸汽”，漏掉了“你通过完形以灵能吸收蒸汽”这一获取来源的说明。"},{"revision_key":"b8a51a2baf55814b910447d4809e55131fd85a83562d44f64d5c30ddf447b2ad","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"terrene-technomancy.lua:312 的技能名是“Spiderbot Shield”，译文“机器人护盾”漏掉了“Spider”（蜘蛛），把特指的蜘蛛机器人泛化成了一般机器人。冻结输入中没有 Spiderbot 的术语条目，无法与同族译名比对，但对照原文可以确认漏了“蜘蛛”。"}]}